Implement user story SKY-004-impl: Implement Express REST API server with /health, /search, /cheapest, and static dashboard

## Story Description
Create src/server.ts with Express app exporting named `app`, all route handlers (/health, /search, /cheapest, /), RAPIDAPI_KEY gating middleware, error handling, and guarded listen(). Create src/public/index.html as a styled dashboard. Configure package.json with start/build scripts, build-time public/ copy, and supertest devDependency. FlightResult must be imported from SKY-002.

## Acceptance Criteria
- src/server.ts exports a named `app` (Express instance) separately from `listen()`; listen is guarded by main-module check matching the tsup output format so `vitest run` never binds a port
- GET /health returns HTTP 200 JSON { status: 'ok', uptime: <positive number> } regardless of RAPIDAPI_KEY presence — health is never gated
- GET / returns HTTP 200 text/html with body equal to contents of src/public/index.html read from file at runtime via fs.readFileSync (not hardcoded inline); never gated by RAPIDAPI_KEY
- src/public/index.html is a styled dashboard with: full-width blue (#1a73e8) header bar with bold white 'Skyscanner Dashboard' title and subtitle; centered white card (max-width ~700px, rounded corners, border, padding) with 2-column grid form (From/To IATA inputs row 1, Date/Adults inputs row 2 with labels); full-width blue 'Search Flights' button; status area with pink error banner, gray empty message, success count; client-side JS fetching GET /search without page reload, disabling button during request, rendering results table
- GET /search with valid params returns 200 { flights: FlightResult[], count, searchedAt } where count === flights.length and searchedAt is ISO-8601 distinct per request; missing from/to/date → 400 { error }; adults defaults to 1 if absent, non-numeric adults → 400 { error }
- GET /cheapest with valid params returns 200 with cheapest FlightResult (price ≤ all others); empty results → 404 { error }; missing from/to/date → 400 { error }; adults forwarded or defaults to 1
- RAPIDAPI_KEY absent → /search and /cheapest return 503 { error: 'RAPIDAPI_KEY not configured' }; SkyscannerClient throws → 500 { error: string } without crash or unhandled rejection; /health and / unaffected
- FlightResult imported from SKY-002 type export (not redeclared); package.json has 'start': 'node dist/server.js', build script producing dist/server.js + copying src/public/ to dist/public/; supertest and @types/supertest in devDeps; `npx tsc --noEmit` exits 0





